OL,3,GNEWSASome 'co-operation' between Real
OL,4,Aand Continuity IRA for Omagh bomb,
OL,5,Ainquiry told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere was "some form of operational
OL,8,Fco-operation" between the Real IRA and
OL,9,Fthe Continuity IRA for the Omagh
OL,10,Fbombing, the inquiry into the explosion
OL,11,Fhas heard.
OL,13,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,14,Fpregnant with twins, died in the Real
OL,15,FIRA bombing in the County Tyrone town
OL,16,Fon 15 August 1998 - the biggest single
OL,17,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,19,FIt came less than three months after
OL,20,Fthe people of Northern Ireland had
OL,21,Fvoted yes to the Good Friday Agreement.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
